    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i just told u i'm exhausted and the thought of a doctor right now makes me feel even more stressed. plus the pain isn't even that bad, it's just a dull ache in my leg. surely if it was actually dangerous i wouldn't be able to just sit here typing this? can i just try taking a double dose of aspirin tonight to see if it helps the inflammation and then i'll see how i feel in the morning?",
